{
  "file" : "npc/quests/skills/priest_skills.txt",
  "scripts" : [
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 21,
      "npc" : "Sister Linus",
      "text" : "[Sister Linus]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 22,
      "npc" : "Sister Linus",
      "text" : "Hm? We've met before,"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 23,
      "npc" : "Sister Linus",
      "text" : "haven't we? Then again,"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 24,
      "npc" : "Sister Linus",
      "text" : "all Priests begin to look"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 25,
      "npc" : "Sister Linus",
      "text" : "the same after a while. Ah,"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 26,
      "npc" : "Sister Linus",
      "text" : "were you one of the ones"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 27,
      "npc" : "Sister Linus",
      "text" : "to whom I taught Redemptio?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 29,
      "npc" : "Sister Linus",
      "text" : "[Sister Linus]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 30,
      "npc" : "Sister Linus",
      "text" : "Ah, you've forgotten, have"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 31,
      "npc" : "Sister Linus",
      "text" : "you? Well, it's no problem for"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 32,
      "npc" : "Sister Linus",
      "text" : "me to teach you again. This skill enables you to revive your fallen"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 33,
      "npc" : "Sister Linus",
      "text" : "Party Members by sacrificing"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 34,
      "npc" : "Sister Linus",
      "text" : "your own life for them."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 36,
      "npc" : "Sister Linus",
      "text" : "[Sister Linus]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 37,
      "npc" : "Sister Linus",
      "text" : "^3131FFOh holy and venerable one,"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 38,
      "npc" : "Sister Linus",
      "text" : "we pray to you. Please show"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 39,
      "npc" : "Sister Linus",
      "text" : "us your mercy and guide us"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 40,
      "npc" : "Sister Linus",
      "text" : "with your light. Give us the"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 41,
      "npc" : "Sister Linus",
      "text" : "strength to walk the path of"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 42,
      "npc" : "Sister Linus",
      "text" : "love and sacrifice. Redemptio!^000000"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 45,
      "npc" : "Sister Linus",
      "text" : "[Sister Linus]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 46,
      "npc" : "Sister Linus",
      "text" : "There..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 47,
      "npc" : "Sister Linus",
      "text" : "You should be able"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 48,
      "npc" : "Sister Linus",
      "text" : "to perform Redemptio"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 49,
      "npc" : "Sister Linus",
      "text" : "now. I hope you use it"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 50,
      "npc" : "Sister Linus",
      "text" : "well on your adventures~"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 54,
      "npc" : "Sister Linus",
      "text" : "[Sister Linus]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 55,
      "npc" : "Sister Linus",
      "text" : "I'll always be praying"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 56,
      "npc" : "Sister Linus",
      "text" : "for your safety. Be careful,"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 57,
      "npc" : "Sister Linus",
      "text" : "and I hope that you can bring"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 58,
      "npc" : "Sister Linus",
      "text" : "love and compassion to all"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 59,
      "npc" : "Sister Linus",
      "text" : "whom you meet in your travels."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 66,
      "npc" : "Sister Linus",
      "text" : "[Sister Linus]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 67,
      "npc" : "Sister Linus",
      "text" : "I'll always be praying"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 68,
      "npc" : "Sister Linus",
      "text" : "for your safety. Be careful,"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 69,
      "npc" : "Sister Linus",
      "text" : "and I hope that you can bring"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 70,
      "npc" : "Sister Linus",
      "text" : "love and compassion to all"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 71,
      "npc" : "Sister Linus",
      "text" : "whom you meet in your travels."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 75,
      "npc" : "Sister Linus",
      "text" : "[Sister Linus]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 76,
      "npc" : "Sister Linus",
      "text" : "Please have mercy and"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 77,
      "npc" : "Sister Linus",
      "text" : "spread your light through"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 78,
      "npc" : "Sister Linus",
      "text" : "the world. Guide her with"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 79,
      "npc" : "Sister Linus",
      "text" : "your benevolent wisdom..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 80,
      "npc" : "Sister Linus",
      "text" : "Bless her, and may she"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 81,
      "npc" : "Sister Linus",
      "text" : "be protected by your grace."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 83,
      "npc" : "Sister Linus",
      "text" : "Whom are you praying for, sister?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 84,
      "npc" : "Sister Linus",
      "text" : "[Sister Linus]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 85,
      "npc" : "Sister Linus",
      "text" : "Oh! You startled me!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 86,
      "npc" : "Sister Linus",
      "text" : "Whom am I praying for?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 87,
      "npc" : "Sister Linus",
      "text" : "Well, I once knew a young,"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 88,
      "npc" : "Sister Linus",
      "text" : "playful and merry nun who was"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 89,
      "npc" : "Sister Linus",
      "text" : "also a bit brazen. But I have"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 90,
      "npc" : "Sister Linus",
      "text" : "many joyful memories of her."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 92,
      "npc" : "Sister Linus",
      "text" : "[Sister Linus]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 93,
      "npc" : "Sister Linus",
      "text" : "One day, a group of adventurers"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 94,
      "npc" : "Sister Linus",
      "text" : "came to Prontera Church in hopes of hiring a Priest to accompany"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 95,
      "npc" : "Sister Linus",
      "text" : "them to ^3131DDGlast Heim^000000. It must have been fate that she was the only"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 96,
      "npc" : "Sister Linus",
      "text" : "Priest that was available."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 98,
      "npc" : "Sister Linus",
      "text" : "[Sister Linus]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 99,
      "npc" : "Sister Linus",
      "text" : "I remember that she was"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 100,
      "npc" : "Sister Linus",
      "text" : "so determined to join those"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 101,
      "npc" : "Sister Linus",
      "text" : "adventurers, and we had no"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 102,
      "npc" : "Sister Linus",
      "text" : "choice but to let her go."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 103,
      "npc" : "Sister Linus",
      "text" : "Still, many of us believed"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 104,
      "npc" : "Sister Linus",
      "text" : "that it was too dangerous..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 106,
      "npc" : "Sister Linus",
      "text" : "[Sister Linus]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 107,
      "npc" : "Sister Linus",
      "text" : "I hear that, at first, their"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 108,
      "npc" : "Sister Linus",
      "text" : "ragtag team was able to"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 109,
      "npc" : "Sister Linus",
      "text" : "successfully exterminate"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 110,
      "npc" : "Sister Linus",
      "text" : "a great number of monsters."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 111,
      "npc" : "Sister Linus",
      "text" : "But supporting them as a Priest"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 112,
      "npc" : "Sister Linus",
      "text" : "must have been tough for her..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 114,
      "npc" : "Sister Linus",
      "text" : "[Sister Linus]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 115,
      "npc" : "Sister Linus",
      "text" : "Then, tragedy struck."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 116,
      "npc" : "Sister Linus",
      "text" : "Surrounded by Wanderers,"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 117,
      "npc" : "Sister Linus",
      "text" : "the adventurers quickly fell"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 118,
      "npc" : "Sister Linus",
      "text" : "in defeat, one by one. Soon,"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 119,
      "npc" : "Sister Linus",
      "text" : "the young nun was the only one of the group still standing."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 121,
      "npc" : "Sister Linus",
      "text" : "[Sister Linus]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 122,
      "npc" : "Sister Linus",
      "text" : "Alone against impossible"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 123,
      "npc" : "Sister Linus",
      "text" : "odds, that poor girl had no"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 124,
      "npc" : "Sister Linus",
      "text" : "choice but to try a desperate"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 125,
      "npc" : "Sister Linus",
      "text" : "gamble. She began to chant"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 126,
      "npc" : "Sister Linus",
      "text" : "the ancient holy spell..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 128,
      "npc" : "Sister Linus",
      "text" : "Ancient spell...?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 129,
      "npc" : "Sister Linus",
      "text" : "[Sister Linus]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 130,
      "npc" : "Sister Linus",
      "text" : "Yes! ^FF0000Redemptio^000000!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 131,
      "npc" : "Sister Linus",
      "text" : "A skill that only the"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 132,
      "npc" : "Sister Linus",
      "text" : "most talented Priests"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 133,
      "npc" : "Sister Linus",
      "text" : "can perform! And here she"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 134,
      "npc" : "Sister Linus",
      "text" : "was, a young nun with very"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 135,
      "npc" : "Sister Linus",
      "text" : "little experience, trying it!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 137,
      "npc" : "Sister Linus",
      "text" : "[Sister Linus]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 138,
      "npc" : "Sister Linus",
      "text" : "Redemptio is the last"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 139,
      "npc" : "Sister Linus",
      "text" : "resort skill that can be"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 140,
      "npc" : "Sister Linus",
      "text" : "used to nobly save the"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 141,
      "npc" : "Sister Linus",
      "text" : "lives of others at the cost"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 142,
      "npc" : "Sister Linus",
      "text" : "of ^3131FFsacrificing your own life^000000."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 144,
      "npc" : "Sister Linus",
      "text" : "[Sister Linus]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 145,
      "npc" : "Sister Linus",
      "text" : "Yes, I remember the days"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 146,
      "npc" : "Sister Linus",
      "text" : "she wasn't very interested"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 147,
      "npc" : "Sister Linus",
      "text" : "in studying the Priest and"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 148,
      "npc" : "Sister Linus",
      "text" : "Acolyte skills. Surprisingly,"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 149,
      "npc" : "Sister Linus",
      "text" : "she had learned enough to"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 150,
      "npc" : "Sister Linus",
      "text" : "attempt to cast Redemptio..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 152,
      "npc" : "Sister Linus",
      "text" : "[Sister Linus]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 153,
      "npc" : "Sister Linus",
      "text" : "Miraculously, she succeeded"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 154,
      "npc" : "Sister Linus",
      "text" : "in reviving her party members."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 155,
      "npc" : "Sister Linus",
      "text" : "They quickly used a Yggdrasil"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 156,
      "npc" : "Sister Linus",
      "text" : "Leaf to restore her life, and they defeated the Wanderers and"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 157,
      "npc" : "Sister Linus",
      "text" : "returned home safely."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 159,
      "npc" : "Sister Linus",
      "text" : "[Sister Linus]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 160,
      "npc" : "Sister Linus",
      "text" : "Because of this success, she"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 161,
      "npc" : "Sister Linus",
      "text" : "was promoted to High Priest"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 162,
      "npc" : "Sister Linus",
      "text" : "despite the many mistakes she"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 163,
      "npc" : "Sister Linus",
      "text" : "made in the past. Now she travels the world, helping adventurers"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 164,
      "npc" : "Sister Linus",
      "text" : "in any way that she can."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 166,
      "npc" : "Sister Linus",
      "text" : "[Sister Linus]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 167,
      "npc" : "Sister Linus",
      "text" : "But, well, she'll"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 168,
      "npc" : "Sister Linus",
      "text" : "always be that spunky"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 169,
      "npc" : "Sister Linus",
      "text" : "and joyful girl to me."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 171,
      "npc" : "Sister Linus",
      "placeholders" : [
        "strcharinfo(0)"
      ],
      "text" : "[{0}]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 172,
      "npc" : "Sister Linus",
      "text" : "Wait, you still haven't"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 173,
      "npc" : "Sister Linus",
      "text" : "answered my question."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 174,
      "npc" : "Sister Linus",
      "text" : "Are you praying for this"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 175,
      "npc" : "Sister Linus",
      "text" : "nun? And if so, is she"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 176,
      "npc" : "Sister Linus",
      "text" : "in some kind of danger?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 178,
      "npc" : "Sister Linus",
      "text" : "[Sister Linus]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 179,
      "npc" : "Sister Linus",
      "text" : "Well, a few months ago,"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 180,
      "npc" : "Sister Linus",
      "text" : "she went on a mission to"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 181,
      "npc" : "Sister Linus",
      "text" : "^3131FFLighthalzen^000000, a city in the"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 182,
      "npc" : "Sister Linus",
      "text" : "Schwarzwald Republic. I was"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 183,
      "npc" : "Sister Linus",
      "text" : "just worried since I haven't"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 184,
      "npc" : "Sister Linus",
      "text" : "heard from her in a while."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 186,
      "npc" : "Sister Linus",
      "text" : "[Sister Linus]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 187,
      "npc" : "Sister Linus",
      "text" : "I come here to pray for"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 188,
      "npc" : "Sister Linus",
      "text" : "her everyday, and hope that"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 189,
      "npc" : "Sister Linus",
      "text" : "she'll come back safely and"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 190,
      "npc" : "Sister Linus",
      "text" : "share stories of her adventures"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 191,
      "npc" : "Sister Linus",
      "text" : "with me. Ooh, we'll talk all night long! It'll be so much fun!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 193,
      "npc" : "Sister Linus",
      "text" : "[Sister Linus]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 194,
      "npc" : "Sister Linus",
      "text" : "Goodness, I've been"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 195,
      "npc" : "Sister Linus",
      "text" : "running my mouth! I'm"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 196,
      "npc" : "Sister Linus",
      "text" : "sorry to keep you, did you"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 197,
